Package: mogiw
Type: Package
Title: The Marshal–Olkin Generalized Inverse Weibull Distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c( person("Atchanut", "Rattanalertnusorn", email = "atchanut_r@rmutt.ac.th",
      role = c("aut", "cre")))
Maintainer: Atchanut Rattanalertnusorn <atchanut_r@rmutt.ac.th>
Description: Density, distribution function, quantile function, 
    and random generation function based on Salem, H. M. (2019)<doi:10.5539/mas.v13n2p54>.
    In addition, a numerical method for maximum likelihood estimation is provided.
